erly  Tatiana will lose vital points  regardless Manya is pleased with  Tatiana's performance apart from the  gallop which didn't work they only  managed a few jumps right at the end but  it was really good  Baskins food well what disaster  you're in trouble  jumping this afternoon hopefully she'll  do it we've practiced so much it worked  before but okay that wasn't brilliant  not great the other contestants are in  high spirits winning isn't everything at  the Special Olympics everyone's allowed  on the podium  [Music]  the proximity receipt  tatyana write them in short eat the  vectors X comma noise  [Applause]  [Music]  you weren't expecting that were you I  [Music]  wasn't expecting it I couldn't really  tell how I done  we didn't hear what the judges had given  us so I was really excited to find out  how I was placed disappointing sure  you're not disappointed after that round  she'll be satisfied with a silver or a  bronze but she wouldn't say no to a gold  either we're working on it there are  still a number of categories where  tatianna could win her long four gold  medal she already has a few at home but  before the next event she has a look  around  to see what the other athletes are doing  she watches the judo for a while  [Applause]  [Music]  [Applause]  [Applause]  [Music]  [Applause]  along with the competitive events the  Special Olympics also hosts fun  activities that help the athletes unwind  like stand-up paddleboarding cloudy  arrival alook saunas her daughter takes  to the water she's proud of her Tatyana  has a job as an assistant gardener in a  workshop for disabled people but she  needs a lot of help with daily chores  such as buying groceries cooking and  running errands Tatyana relies on her  mother and sister her mother gave up her  job as a teacher to help look after  Tatiana it wouldn't be a good idea to do  everything for her because there might  be times when I can't  oh I'm no longer in a position to but  Manya shouldn't have to do everything  for her either she shouldn't have to  manage everything alone but it's all  okay  Tatiana is strong enough and able to  cope with life by herself her own way  laughing back in the stable and Choji  needs to be fed the next event will be  taking place in a few hours the horse  jumping event this is the one that  Tatiana is most nervous about I can get  confused by which jump comes after which  I have to make sure I don't lose my  sense of direction in the obstacle  course the route is only announced at  the last minute  Tatiana doesn't have much time to take  it in we need to go round the little  house then the bench then around the  corner okay  this is her biggest challenge when all  the months of training have been leading  up to she can't lose her focus now  apart from one small error she gets off  to a smooth start  but then intro Qi decides to dig in her  heels she refuses to clear the hurdle  second attempt the same thing happens  Tatiana  isn't giving up she tries again  but the judges don't award her any  points she won't be getting the medal  everyone's a bit sad Tatyana wanted it  to work  it wasn't necessarily about coming first  but about the actual performance about  getting the sequence right not even  words of comfort from fellow athletes  can cheer her up I'm glad she cleared  the last hurdle you can't just leave it  out I don't know what the problem was  she just didn't feel like it the day  ends with an appearance as Peter Pan the  whole team is involved as well as a  horse woman who's not part of the  Special Olympics it looks like a bit of  fun but more medals are awarded at the  end of the show nothing escaped the  judges eagle eyes  [Music]  all the competing athletes are hoping to  qualify for the International Special  Olympics at Abu Dhabi next year for  Tatiana it would be a dream come true  I'm applying to be a spokesperson for  the international event that's one of my  goals for the future  another bronze medal  if Tatiana is d